## What this does not cover

Raw artifacts in `intake/` are documents published by Vermont supervisory unions, school
districts and state agencies. They are stored here exactly as released, unedited, as the
provenance record for the normalized data. They are not this project's work and this licence
does not apply to them; their copyright status is whatever it was when the issuing body
published them. Most are public records of Vermont public bodies.

## Attribution and accuracy

If you reuse the normalized data, please link back to the source repository so that readers can
reach the provenance records and the correction history.

Please also carry across the verification status of anything you reuse. A figure derived from an
unverified statutory parameter is marked as such throughout this project precisely so that it
cannot be mistaken for a settled one, and reproducing it without that marking would defeat the
point.
